  "implementation": [
    "Persist active operation token/owner/dimension/target/phase in tile NBT and sealed removal receipt",
    "Owner/operator receipt inspection; operator-only historical receipts with no trustworthy owner",
    "Nearby owned/operator-accessible host inspection; sorted four-token pages bounded by 4096 records",
    "Opaque, missing, mismatched and wrong-dimension contexts never grant recovery clearance",
    "Validated settlement clears only matching active context; unresolved world fences remain independent"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "No release, recovery, replay, redemption or minting API",
    "Only active handoff context linked to a removal receipt; overlapping tokens remain independently inspectable by target",
    "Unresolved pre-upgrade faults lack destination history; not reconstructed",
    "Native helper/receipt/phase/pagination permission fixtures; ordinary stock-client regression does not certify diagnostic command chat rendering",
    "No full-process crash atomicity, hidden provider aliases, installed optional providers, dedicated multiplayer or sustained full-server acceptance"
  ],
